cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Panzer's Hepp-bound conjecture and the Panzer-Yeats Martin conjecture for phi^4 periods are incompatible"
abstract: >-
  Three pairs of completed primitive 13-loop phi^4 graphs with exactly equal
  Hepp bounds and different Martin sequences, so Panzer's Conjecture 1.2 and
  Panzer-Yeats Conjecture 1.10 cannot both hold. Includes verification code,
  period logs, and a Lean 4 proof of the incompatibility.
